cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Taloside Screening Pipeline
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Adam
    family-names: Holohan
    email: adamholohan6@gmail.com
    affiliation: National University of Ireland, Galway
repository-code: https://github.com/adamholohan6/taloside-screening-pipeline
abstract: >-
  Virtual library generation, drug-likeness filtering, PAINS screening, and
  AutoDock Vina docking for taloside-triazole derivatives against Galectin-3
  (PDB 3ZSJ). Enumerates CuAAC 1,4- and RuAAC 1,5-triazole regioisomers,
  applies carbohydrate-adjusted Lipinski and PAINS filters, ranks candidates
  with a composite lead score, and docks the survivors against the Galectin-3
  carbohydrate-recognition domain.
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - rdkit
  - autodock-vina
  - molecular-docking
  - galectin-3
  - virtual-screening
  - click-chemistry
